  "origin": {
    "kind": "new",
    "note": "Written for live-mix on cpp/kit. A behavioural sketch of a tape machine (emphasis around a soft saturator, a wobbling transport, playback equalisation per speed, dropouts, hiss), not a model of any one deck or of magnetic hysteresis. Hiss is only made while the device is awake: it carries on for a second after the input stops, fades, and an idle track is exactly silent."
